{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c43807d-db0e-11ef-a7dd-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c438061-db0e-11ef-b1a0-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"勝州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"勝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"胜州","place_note":"总部设内蒙古托克托县","resolved_place_entity_id":2224,"start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b842b272-db0e-11ef-8193-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"24思結部落飢貧，朔州刺史新豐張儉招集之，其不來者，仍居磧北，親屬私相往還，儉亦不禁。及儉徙勝州都督，州司奏思結將叛，詔儉往察之。儉單騎入其部落說諭，徙之代州，卽以儉檢校代州都督，思結卒無叛者。儉因勸之營田，歲大稔。儉恐虜蓄積多，有異志，奏請和糴以充邊儲。部落喜，營田轉力，而邊備實焉。","content_fanyi":"思结部落饥馑贫困，朔州刺史、新丰人张俭招集他们，其中没有应召前来的，仍留居漠北，他们的亲属私下相互往来，张俭也不加禁止。等到张俭调任胜州都督，朔州衙门的官员上奏说思结部落将要反叛，唐太宗下诏让张俭前往察看。张俭独自一人骑马进入思结部落，向他们宣讲朝廷招抚的意旨，把他们迁往代州，朝廷随即任命张俭为检校代州都督，思结部最终没有一个人反叛。张俭于是劝他们开垦田地从事耕作，当年获得大丰收。张俭担心思结部人的积蓄增多后会产生反叛的意图，于是上奏请求由官府出钱收购他们的粮食，以充实边防储备。思结部落很高兴，经营耕作更加卖力，边防储备也由此得到充实。","content_jianti_auto":"24思结部落饥贫，朔州刺史新丰张俭招集之，其不来者，仍居碛北，亲属私相往还，俭亦不禁。及俭徙胜州都督，州司奏思结将叛，诏俭往察之。俭单骑入其部落说谕，徙之代州，即以俭检校代州都督，思结卒无叛者。俭因劝之营田，岁大稔。俭恐虏蓄积多，有异志，奏请和籴以充边储。部落喜，营田转力，而边备实焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18819,"number":24,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百九十三 (唐紀九) / 太宗文武大聖大廣孝皇帝上之中 / 四年 / 第 37 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b842b266-db0e-11ef-875d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":630},"tongjian_id":"b842b266-db0e-11ef-875d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"勝州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"力將，卽亮翻；下同。夏，戶雅翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"力将，即亮翻；下同。夏，户雅翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf1-db0e-11ef-971b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf3-db0e-11ef-9c5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北河","place_name_jianti_auto":"北河","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf4-db0e-11ef-ba8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朔方","place_name_jianti_auto":"朔方","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf5-db0e-11ef-9fba-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"新秦","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf6-db0e-11ef-83a1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"河南者，北河之南，卽朔方、新秦之地。","note_content_jianti_auto":"河南者，北河之南，即朔方、新秦之地。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf2-db0e-11ef-a138-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"延陀","people_name_jianti_auto":"延陀","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf9-db0e-11ef-9f72-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"眞珠","people_name_jianti_auto":"真珠","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafa-db0e-11ef-b20b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延陀","people_name_jianti_auto":"延陀","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafb-db0e-11ef-a474-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"眞珠","people_name_jianti_auto":"真珠","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafc-db0e-11ef-85f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"太宗","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafd-db0e-11ef-8d09-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"眞珠","people_name_jianti_auto":"真珠","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafe-db0e-11ef-b674-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"磧，七迹翻。還，從宣翻，又如字。考異曰：高宗實錄云：「會延陀死，耀威漠北而還。」其意指眞珠爲延陀也。按眞珠憚太宗威靈，不敢入寇，又死在九月；而此云冬來寇，必非眞珠也。田仁會傳作十八年，亦誤也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"碛，七迹翻。还，从宣翻，又如字。考异曰：高宗实录云：「会延陀死，耀威漠北而还。」其意指真珠为延陀也。按真珠惮太宗威灵，不敢入寇，又死在九月；而此云冬来寇，必非真珠也。田仁会传作十八年，亦误也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf8-db0e-11ef-8823-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"幷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"幷州","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb04-db0e-11ef-9ec3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樂平","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐平","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb05-db0e-11ef-a515-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼山","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽山","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb06-db0e-11ef-afac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平城","place_name_jianti_auto":"平城","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb07-db0e-11ef-a062-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石艾","place_name_jianti_auto":"石艾","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb08-db0e-11ef-b5a4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽州","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb09-db0e-11ef-944b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樂平郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐平郡","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb0a-db0e-11ef-ada0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"箕州","place_name_jianti_auto":"箕州","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb0b-db0e-11ef-a154-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb0c-db0e-11ef-b612-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔚州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔚州","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb0d-db0e-11ef-9dbb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb0e-db0e-11ef-ad38-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"代郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"代郡","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb0f-db0e-11ef-8131-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靈丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵丘","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb10-db0e-11ef-930a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb11-db0e-11ef-b22e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靈丘縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵丘县","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb12-db0e-11ef-8ab9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"肆州","place_name_jianti_auto":"肆州","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb13-db0e-11ef-8601-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb14-db0e-11ef-b9c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"肆州","place_name_jianti_auto":"肆州","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb15-db0e-11ef-aa7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靈丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵丘","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb16-db0e-11ef-b720-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"易州","place_name_jianti_auto":"易州","place_note":"河北省易县","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb17-db0e-11ef-a5a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"飛狐","place_name_jianti_auto":"飞狐","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb18-db0e-11ef-927d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔚州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔚州","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb19-db0e-11ef-b034-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"云州","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb1a-db0e-11ef-b08e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲中郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"云中郡","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb1b-db0e-11ef-81ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朔州","place_name_jianti_auto":"朔州","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb1c-db0e-11ef-a9e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北定襄城","place_name_jianti_auto":"北定襄城","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb1d-db0e-11ef-878e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"定襄縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"定襄县","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb1e-db0e-11ef-bab6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb1f-db0e-11ef-8b9c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馬邑郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"马邑郡","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb20-db0e-11ef-beb3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲內縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"云内县","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb21-db0e-11ef-b3c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"恆安鎭","place_name_jianti_auto":"恒安镇","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb22-db0e-11ef-9532-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb23-db0e-11ef-930f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平城","place_name_jianti_auto":"平城","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb24-db0e-11ef-b64e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"定襄縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"定襄县","start_index":139,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb25-db0e-11ef-a70d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲中縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"云中县","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb26-db0e-11ef-9c2e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"武德三年，分幷州之樂平、遼山、平城、石艾置遼州樂平郡；八年，改曰箕州。後周置蔚州於漢代郡之靈丘，隋廢州，以靈丘縣屬肆州；唐武德六年，分肆州之靈丘、易州之飛狐地置蔚州。雲州，雲中郡，貞觀十四年自朔州北定襄城徙治定襄縣，其地實隋馬邑郡之雲內縣恆安鎭，卽後魏所都平城也。開元十八年，改定襄縣爲雲中縣。蔚，紆勿翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"武德三年，分幷州之乐平、辽山、平城、石艾置辽州乐平郡；八年，改曰箕州。后周置蔚州于汉代郡之灵丘，隋废州，以灵丘县属肆州；唐武德六年，分肆州之灵丘、易州之飞狐地置蔚州。云州，云中郡，贞观十四年自朔州北定襄城徙治定襄县，其地实隋马邑郡之云内县恒安镇，即后魏所都平城也。开元十八年，改定襄县为云中县。蔚，纡勿翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb03-db0e-11ef-a8a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb28-db0e-11ef-82c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"姚興","people_name_jianti_auto":"姚兴","start_index":166,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb29-db0e-11ef-bf72-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"元皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"元皇帝","start_index":214,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb2a-db0e-11ef-9925-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":